BranchTraits: {
	Ambusher: Ambusher:  Greatly reduces aggro while holding the weapon
	DefenderProfession: Defender:  Right-click to raise your shield and guard; takes priority over left-click
	Charger: Charger:  Left-click to thrust; right-click for a long-distance charge with a cooldown
	PrimalCaster: Primal Caster:  Release violet flames and create allied servants when nearby enemies die
	Fortress: Fortress:  Launch ranged artillery attacks while guarding with a shield
	Protector: Protector:  Hold right-click to guard; cannot attack while guarding, but gains 50% DEF and 50% damage reduction
	ArtsProtector: Arts Protector:  Attacks deal magic damage during skills
	SentinelProtector: Sentinel Protector:  Perform powerful ranged Arts attacks
	Juggernaut: Juggernaut:  Hold right-click to guard; cannot attack while guarding, but gains 50% DEF and 50% damage reduction
	Duelist: Duelist:  Right-click to charge fiercely, dealing heavy collision damage
	Summoner: Summoner:  Deploy drones and switch modules for different attacks and control effects
}
